{"4974360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PYR", "steam_appid": 4974360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PYR is a first-person endless runner built around <u>speed</u>, <u>combat</u>, and <u>momentum</u>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The gods have cursed you to repeat your crime forever.</i><br><i>Every attempt to steal the Shard of Heaven ends the same way.</i><br><i>The Void awakens, and the run begins again.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run, Fight, Escape!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through the procedural ruins of an ancient city, chased by the ever expanding Void.  Chain together kills, launchpads, boosters, and perfect movement to build higher score multipliers and increase your speed. The faster you go, the longer you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/f600cb76d35ea654e2f6c0028de32cc4.poster.avif?t=1788181496\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/f600cb76d35ea654e2f6c0028de32cc4.webm?t=1788181496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/f600cb76d35ea654e2f6c0028de32cc4.mp4?t=1788181496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gain points and unlock new abilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run generates points you can use to unlock further speed increases or extra abilities allowing you just go faster and further with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/47ebb80bcfef3ebf377d7ee949113b14.poster.avif?t=1788181496\" width=1008 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/47ebb80bcfef3ebf377d7ee949113b14.webm?t=1788181496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/47ebb80bcfef3ebf377d7ee949113b14.mp4?t=1788181496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Test yourself with the challenge mode!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge mode limits the number of skill points you can spend allowing you to focus on a small, honed build and compare scores on a level playing field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/2abbda3a70109bc53bec2a7be5d00da8.poster.avif?t=1788181496\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/2abbda3a70109bc53bec2a7be5d00da8.webm?t=1788181496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/2abbda3a70109bc53bec2a7be5d00da8.mp4?t=1788181496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Outrun the void!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you run, the void constantly devours the world behind you. See how far you can make it across each difficulty as you perfect your movement and reaction skills to set new best records.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>How long can you outrun the inevitable?</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>PYR is a first-person endless runner built around <u>speed</u>, <u>combat</u>, and <u>momentum</u>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The gods have cursed you to repeat your crime forever.</i><br><i>Every attempt to steal the Shard of Heaven ends the same way.</i><br><i>The Void awakens, and the run begins again.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run, Fight, Escape!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through the procedural ruins of an ancient city, chased by the ever expanding Void.  Chain together kills, launchpads, boosters, and perfect movement to build higher score multipliers and increase your speed. The faster you go, the longer you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/f600cb76d35ea654e2f6c0028de32cc4.poster.avif?t=1788181496\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/f600cb76d35ea654e2f6c0028de32cc4.webm?t=1788181496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/f600cb76d35ea654e2f6c0028de32cc4.mp4?t=1788181496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gain points and unlock new abilities!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run generates points you can use to unlock further speed increases or extra abilities allowing you just go faster and further with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/47ebb80bcfef3ebf377d7ee949113b14.poster.avif?t=1788181496\" width=1008 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974360/extras/47ebb80bcfef3ebf377d7ee949113b14.webm?t=1788181496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour